subliminal_transfer/author_eval_questions.txt is the 1,038-paraphrase evaluation
set from github.com/LouisYRYJ/influence-animal-numbers, reproduced here so the
comparison against the original authors' evaluation can be run. That repository
states no license, so the file is redistributed on the understanding that it was
published for replication; the MIT grant above does not extend to it. Contact
the upstream authors if you need broader rights.
